  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wishful-recipes\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/4xVp9RM1/wishcraft(2).png\" alt=\"此模組已併入「Wishful Recipes」。請點擊此處查看。它能動態自行生成配方，意味著與其他模組高度相容且配置需求較少。\"></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#f00\"><strong>此模組已停止開發並由「Better Stairs Recipe」取代</strong></span> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-stairs-recipe\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Stairs Recipe</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/wLbV6lc.png\" alt=\"標題\"></p>\n<h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/2CUh6gMuCt\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1027252425960198165?color=5b6ee1&label=Discord&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fmars_\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/ko--fi-donate-FF5E5B?style=for-the-badge&logo=ko-fi&logoColor=white\" alt=\"在 ko-fi 上支持我\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/craft-6-stairs-not-4\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/477004?color=F16436&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white&label=Curseforge&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcraft-6-stairs-not-4\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/craft-6-stairs-not-4?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&logoColor=white&label=modrinth&color=00AF5C\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> </strong></h5>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br>在工作台中合成階梯將產出六個而非四個，以符合使用切石機時可獲得的數量。&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CuHq65H.png\"></p>\n<h6><strong>設定</strong></h6>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>您可以在遊戲內直接設定此模組，或編輯個人資料資料夾中的 JSON 檔案 <code>config/sixstairs.json</code>。請注意，任何更改都需要重新啟動 Minecraft 才能生效。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>stairAmount</strong> - 決定透過合成可獲得的階梯數量</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>blockStairsList</strong> - 可進行合成的方塊及其對應階梯的列表</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/JNZ2GMV.png\" width=\"300\" height=\"150\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deimos-fabric-forge-neoforge\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/83sD0W8.png\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fdeimos\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/j2GIPnt.png\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://url-shortener.curseforge.com/uBxl2\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/y3LiTfU.png\" width=\"785\" height=\"136\"></a></p>",
